Bundle-Name: Fennec OGC Features API
Bundle-Description: The protocol neutral feature access SPI of Fennec OGC Features: collection \
 descriptors derived from annotated EClasses, feature queries over the Fennec query IR and the \
 FeatureSource a store implements.

-library: enableEMF

-buildpath: \
	org.eclipse.fennec.expression.model;version=latest,\
	org.eclipse.fennec.query.model;version=latest
